There has been some progress on this and I've an experimental API that semi-works with the chore system now, but I will require more work and testing on my end.

Surface wise there will be this
` public static void SendPacketToAllEx2<T>(T packet, short packetId, bool viaChore = false, bool instantMessage = false)`
A rather simple function, so in theory all users would need to do is update any callsite to use this.

The other sync functions will remain for now for legacy purposes.

I expect this to be in for the august update, but no promises.

In the meantime, I would appreciate any help at identifying any ChoreTypes, the more we can map this out the more it'll help out in the long run.

Currently I've got this
